            "notes": "This deck focuses on a fast-paced aggressive strategy with Juri, Master of the Revue as the commander. It includes a mix of low-cost creatures like Goblin Guide and Bonecrusher Giant, along with burn spells like Lightning Bolt and Fireblast to quickly reduce the opponent's life total. The deck also includes disruption cards like Thoughtseize and Duress to disrupt the opponent's game plan. Additionally, there are sacrifice outlets such as Viscera Seer and Carrion Feeder to trigger Juri's ability and generate value from sacrificing creatures. Overall, the goal of this deck is to apply early pressure, control the board, and finish off the opponent before they have a chance to stabilize."
